<title>USA: Superior Industries awarded first.</title>
<headline>Superior Industries awarded first.</headline>
<dateline>VAN NUYS, Calif. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superior Industries International Inc said it was awarded a multi-million dollar contract from Ford Motor Co to supply aluminum road wheels for the F-150 pickup truck.</p>
<p>The contract follows a recent multi-million contract from Ford to supply three aluminum road wheel styles for its 1998 Lincoln Navigator Sport Utility vehicle, including a chrome-plated version.</p>
</text>
